      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I have to be real honest, I can't stand trying to look through my online friends when they're in private instances since the names and status are the same color I don't know how they messed this up but it's a nightmare on my eyes. The yellow made sense and looked good. Readability was a feature they did away with for... some reason?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
