  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The nameplates have been changed back to yellow, but friends are still shown in white in lists. This inconsistency makes the UI feel less cohesive.\n\nI don't think there's a compelling reason to display them in white (or is there? Seriously?), so I think they should simply remain yellow as they were before.\n\nja:\n\nフレンドを黄色で表すルールは統一した方が良い（UIの一貫性）\n\n中途半端にネームプレートだけ黄色に戻ったが、一覧で白色なのは一貫性がなくUIとしてよくない。\n\n白色にする強い理由は無いと思う（それとも本当にあるのでしょうか？）ので、従来通り黄色にした方が良い。",
